# WOWDamn Backend v2.0

Express.js API server for the WOWDamn Holographic Commerce Operating System.

## Quick Start
npm install && node server.js

## Deploy on Render
Connect this repo on render.com. render.yaml handles all config automatically.

## Environment Variables
- PORT=10000
- NODE_ENV=production
- JWT_SECRET=(generate a 64-char hex string)
- MONGODB_URI=(optional — falls back to in-memory mock data)
- FRONTEND_URL=https://wowdamn.vercel.app

